			"notes": "## DeathLens 0.2.0 — Minecraft 26.x\n\nThis release ports DeathLens 0.2.0 to Minecraft's unobfuscated 26.x client architecture.\n\n### Downloads\n\n- `deathlens-0.2.0+mc26.1.2.jar` for Minecraft 26.1.2\n- `deathlens-0.2.0+mc26.2.jar` for Minecraft 26.2\n\n### Requirements\n\n- Java 25\n- Fabric Loader 0.19.3 or newer\n- Fabric API matching the selected Minecraft version\n\n### Compatibility changes\n\n- Migrated to the non-remapping Fabric Loom plugin\n- Updated GUI rendering to the render-state extraction API\n- Updated key mapping, registry identifier, screen and input APIs\n- Preserved inventory item and active-effect icon rendering\n\nBoth targets pass the automated test suite and were smoke-tested by launching the Minecraft client to the main menu."
